      },
      "worked": "The odd- and even-positioned terms each form a geometric series with common ratio $\\frac12\\times\\frac13=\\frac16$. Both converge since $\\left|\\frac16\\right|<1$.\n\n$$\\begin{align*}S&=1+\\frac12+\\frac16+\\frac1{12}+\\frac1{36}+\\frac1{72}+\\cdots\\\\S&=\\left(1+\\frac16+\\frac1{36}+\\cdots\\right)+\\left(\\frac12+\\frac1{12}+\\frac1{72}+\\cdots\\right)\\\\S&=\\frac{1}{1-\\frac16}+\\frac{\\frac12}{1-\\frac16}\\\\S&=\\frac65+\\frac35\\\\S&=\\frac95.\\end{align*}$$",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
